<section class="mentor-shell" style="padding:0"><div class="mentor-banner"><div><small>PILOTAGE MENTORAT</small><h1>Mentors, dossiers & coaching live.</h1><p>Contrôlez les candidatures, programmez les entretiens et supervisez les séances payées.</p></div><a class="mentor-btn alt" href="/admin/integrations">Paramétrer live & SMTP</a></div><div class="mentor-warning"><strong>Politique IFMAP</strong>Un mentor ne doit être publié qu’après contrôle du dossier. Les paiements reconnus sont uniquement ceux validés par la passerelle en ligne de la plateforme.</div><div class="section-head compact"><div><h2>Candidatures mentors</h2><p>Contrôle documentaire, compétences et entretien</p></div></div><div class="admin-mentor-grid"><?php foreach($mentors as $m): ?><article class="admin-mentor-card"><header><div class="mentor-avatar"><?php if(!empty($m['avatar'])): ?><img src="<?= htmlspecialchars($m['avatar']) ?>" alt=""><?php else: ?><?= htmlspecialchars(strtoupper(substr($m['name'],0,1))) ?><?php endif ?></div><div><strong><?= htmlspecialchars($m['name']) ?></strong><small><?= htmlspecialchars($m['email']) ?></small></div></header><div style="margin:12px 0"><span class="mentor-status <?= htmlspecialchars($m['dossier_status']) ?>"><?= htmlspecialchars(strtoupper($m['dossier_status'])) ?></span></div><p><?= htmlspecialchars($m['headline']??'') ?></p><p><strong><?= (int)$m['document_count'] ?></strong> document(s) · <strong><?= (int)$m['verified_skills'] ?></strong> compétence(s) vérifiée(s)</p><p><?= !empty($m['identity_verified'])?'✓':'○' ?> Identité · <?= !empty($m['credentials_verified'])?'✓':'○' ?> Références · <?= !empty($m['interview_completed'])?'✓':'○' ?> Entretien</p><form class="admin-mentor-actions mentor-form" method="post" action="/admin/mentorat/mentor"><input type="hidden" name="mentor_id" value="<?= (int)$m['id'] ?>"><label>Notes internes<textarea name="admin_notes" rows="2"><?= htmlspecialchars($m['admin_notes']??'') ?></textarea></label><label>Date d’entretien<input type="datetime-local" name="interview_at" value="<?= !empty($m['interview_at'])?htmlspecialchars(date('Y-m-d\TH:i',strtotime($m['interview_at']))):'' ?>"></label><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px"><button class="mentor-btn ghost" name="action" value="review">Mettre en revue</button><button class="mentor-btn ghost" name="action" value="interview">Programmer entretien</button><button class="mentor-btn ghost" name="action" value="verify-skills">Vérifier compétences</button><button class="mentor-btn" name="action" value="approve">Valider mentor</button><button class="mentor-btn ghost" name="action" value="reject">Refuser</button></div></form></article><?php endforeach ?><?php if(!$mentors): ?><div class="mentor-panel">Aucune candidature mentor.</div><?php endif ?></div>
<div class="section-head compact" style="margin-top:32px"><div><h2>Demandes & séances</h2><p>Suivi opérationnel et financier</p></div></div><div class="mentor-panel" style="overflow:auto"><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse"><thead><tr><th>Apprenant</th><th>Mentor</th><th>Objet</th><th>Date</th><th>Montant</th><th>Paiement</th><th>Statut</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($requests as $r): ?><tr><td><?= htmlspecialchars($r['learner_name']) ?></td><td><?= htmlspecialchars($r['mentor_name']) ?></td><td><?= htmlspecialchars($r['subject']) ?></td><td><?= htmlspecialchars(date('d/m/Y H:i',strtotime($r['scheduled_at']))) ?></td><td><?= number_format((float)$r['amount'],0,',',' ') ?> FCFA</td><td><span class="mentor-status <?= htmlspecialchars($r['payment_status']) ?>"><?= htmlspecialchars($r['payment_status']) ?></span></td><td><?= htmlspecialchars($r['status']) ?></td><td><form method="post" action="/admin/mentorat/session" style="display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap"><input type="hidden" name="request_id" value="<?= (int)$r['id'] ?>"><?php if($r['payment_status']==='paid'): ?><button class="mentor-btn ghost" name="action" value="confirm">Confirmer</button><button class="mentor-btn" name="action" value="complete">Terminer</button><?php endif ?><button class="mentor-btn ghost" name="action" value="cancel">Annuler</button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach ?></tbody></table></div></section>
